  "historyNote": "#1769, eff 6-30-81; ss by #2408, eff 6-30-83; ss by #2889, eff 10-22-84, EXPIRED 10-22-90 New. #5436, eff 7-22-92, EXPIRED: 7-22-98 New. #7218, eff 3-29-00, EXPIRED: 3-29-08 New. #10464, eff 11-26-13, EXPIRED: 11-26-23 New. #13947, eff 4-30-24, EXPIRED: 10-27-24 New. #14128, eff 11-26-24, EXPIRES: 11-26-34",
